      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d75104f911b409d7",
      "translationZh": "为 /code-review 添加了 --max-findings <n>|all，以报告比通常限制更多或更少的发现；该选择将被重复使用，直到您传递 --max-findings default",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f8fd1f098a17431",
      "translationZh": "添加了 Ctrl+F 以按名称查找会话，以及 Alt+↑/↓ 以在代理视图中在组之间跳转；两者以及重命名都可以在 keybindings. 中重新绑定",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "681b4f78910e28f4",
      "translationZh": "添加了在批准计划时对新的权限模式的屏幕阅读器模式公告，包括使用 Shift+Tab 时",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aea0c7ba9924273c",
      "translationZh": "修复了响应中途 API 超时导致回合失败的问题：非交互式会话和子代理现在将从部分响应继续，并且仅思考响应会被重试",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "820dbd1b81ae7c24",
      "translationZh": "修复了长对话在最后一条回复报告零 token 使用量时，未能自动压缩而是报错“Prompt is too long”的问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b71875c169e1824",
      "translationZh": "修复了 --resume 有时会在压缩刚刚恢复文件和其他上下文后丢失这些内容的问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
